        "[Verso]\nCarried on the blowing breeze\nLike your warm breath once was\n\n[Refrão]\nCome and lean on my empty heart\nI can't live a single day without you\nLet the music heal our wounds\nUnderneath the silver moons",
        "[Verso]\nYour smile that becomes clear when I close my eyes\nThe more I try to erase it, the more it hurts\n\n[Refrão]\nEven if seasons go and come again\nMy heart is completely filled with you\nNo matter where you are now\nI will find you somehow",
