        "[Verso]\nPut anger into the sharp guitar riff\nTear apart the world full of lies\n\n[Refrão]\nBecome a burning flame and soar high\nI will go my way as I please!\nNo more compromise, no more chains\nOnly fire in our veins",
        "[Verso]\nRoaring engine sound makes me excited\nThe flames coloring the asphalt red\n\n[Refrão]\nOnly look ahead, there are no brakes\nFly beyond that far limit line!\nSpeeding up, breaking free\nThis is who I want to be",
        "[Verso]\nEven if a harsh storm sweeps over me\nMy strong wings will not break\n\n[Refrão]\nLike the sun rising through the darkness\nRoar hot and sing the victory!\nLet the thunder roll and shake\nEvery promise we will make",
        "[Verso]\nScreaming sound under the red spotlight\nRun to the end even if the world ignores me\n\n[Refrão]\nFor the rock and roll spirit in my chest\nExplode your last energy!\nPlay it loud, play it wild\nNo longer the quiet child",
        "[Verso]\nMy dream to rise again even if I fall\nWake up the wildness inside me and howl\n\n[Refrão]\nThrow away the cowardly rules of the world\nPlant the rock flag of victory high!\nNo fear, no regrets today\nWe will do it our own way",
