        "[Verso]\nSprint on the free runway of our own\nSmash the darkness blocking the front\n\n[Refrão]\nMy heart burning hot and wild\nRule the world with rock spirit!\nNo turning back, no delay\nWe are here to seize the day",
        "[Verso]\nBurn my soul like a dynamite\nShake up this boring world\n\n[Refrão]\nRide the body on the unstoppable drum beat\nScream out until the final second!\nLet the amplifiers blow\nHere we go, here we go"
