        "[Verso]\nClock ticking fast, no time to waste\nEvery single challenge must be faced\n\n[Refrão]\nWe hustle hard, we make it count\nNo matter the pressure or the amount\nKeep your head up, keep your eyes wide\nFeel the power swelling deep inside",
