        "[Verso]\nFrom the city lights to the dark alley\nWe gather our crew, prepare to rally\n\n[Refrão]\nThis is the story of our survival\nStanding strong against any rival\nFlow so smooth, beat so tight\nWe are ruling the city tonight",
