        "[Verso]\nSitting on the old porch in the evening sun\nNow that the busy day is done\n\n[Refrão]\nPlucking the strings, watching the sky turn red\nThinking of all the words you said\nAcoustic harmony, soft and low\nWatching the shadows slowly grow",
        "[Verso]\nWalking on the sandy beach at night\nUnder the moon's pale silver light\n\n[Refrão]\nOnly the sound of waves and my guitar\nWondering where on earth you are\nBut the music keeps me warm and safe\nIn this beautiful, quiet space",
        "[Verso]\nWinter morning, cup of hot tea\nJust my guitar and me\n\n[Refrão]\nLooking at the snow falling slow\nFeel the warm fire's gentle glow\nSimple melody, cozy and sweet\nMaking my winter day complete",
        "[Verso]\nSpring flowers blooming along the path\nNo room for anger or for wrath\n\n[Refrão]\nJust a happy acoustic stride\nWith you walking by my side\nSinging a song of hope and cheer\nNow that the warm days are here"
