        "[Verse]\nNeon reflections on the wet asphalt\nIf we fall, it is nobody's fault\n\n[Chorus]\nBut we rise up, stronger than before\nKnocking down every closed-up door\nListen to the scratch, listen to the bass\nWe are taking over this entire space",
        "[Verse]\nGrowing up with dreams larger than the sky\nWatching the trains pass quickly by\n\n[Chorus]\nNow I write my story in these lines\nLooking at the stars and how they align\nFrom nothing to everything, that's the plan\nWatch me do it because I know I can",
        "[Verse]\nHoodie pulled low, block out the noise\nFinding my rhythm, finding my voice\n\n[Chorus]\nNo fake friends, no empty words\nOnly the realest stories to be heard\nBeat keeps dropping, flow keeps going\nUnder the streetlights, our energy is showing",
        "[Verse]\nShadows dancing on the brick wall\nWe stand tall, we never fall\n\n[Chorus]\nFrom the underground to the main stage\nWriting a brand new history page\nMic check one two, feel the vibe\nThis is the anthem for our tribe",
        "[Verse]\nClock ticking fast, no time to waste\nEvery single challenge must be faced\n\n[Chorus]\nWe hustle hard, we make it count\nNo matter the pressure or the amount\nKeep your head up, keep your eyes wide\nFeel the power swelling deep inside",
