        "[Verse]\nSynthesizer rising high and sweet\nBringing the crowd directly to their feet\n\n[Chorus]\nJump, jump, feel the music flow\nLet the positive energy grow\nInto the night, we fade away\nWe don't care about yesterday",
        "[Verse]\nLaser beams cutting through the air\nHands in the sky without a care\n\n[Chorus]\nTurn the music up, let it blow\nThis is the best party you'll ever know\nSing it out loud, scream it high\nWe are touching the starry sky",
